OL,3,GNEWSAA 2000AD comic hobby turns into
OL,4,AMastermind subject
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boyhood hobby has led a man to making
OL,7,Fit through to a semi-final appearance
OL,8,Fin the famous black Mastermind Chair.
OL,10,FChris Matterface, 54, from Pelsall,
OL,11,Fnear Walsall, appeared on the BBC
OL,12,Fprogramme with his specialist subject
OL,13,Fthe 2000 AD comics from the 1980s and
OL,14,F90s.
OL,16,FGaining a credible 23 points the comic
OL,17,Fenthusiast made it through to the next
OL,18,Fround, where he will have to pick a new
OL,19,Fspecialist topic.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
