OL,3,GNEWSAA 2000AD comic hobby turns into
OL,4,AMastermind subject
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I can't give away exactly what I'm
OL,7,Fanswering questions on in the
OL,8,Fsemi-final, all I'll say is that it's
OL,9,Fpopular music based, but people will
OL,10,Fhave to wait and see exactly what that
OL,11,Fis," he said. The semi final is due to
OL,12,Fbe filmed soon, and will broadcast on
OL,13,FBBC1 and BBCiPlayer at a future date.
